<li>&lt;a href="Pulo%20Ternate%2C%20Ternate"&gt;Pulo Ternate&lt;/a&gt;</<li>
<li>&lt;a href="Ternate%20Kidul%2C%20Ternate"&gt;Ternate Kidul&lt;/a&gt;</<li>
